# Old WordPress permalinks -> new URLs. One line per redirect, e.g.:
#   redir /2019/05/12/clubkampioenschap-2019/ /nieuws/clubkampioenschap-2019 permanent
#   redir /kalender/ /kalender permanent
#   redir /wp-content/uploads/* /media{path} permanent   (only if media keep old names)
# Generate this list from the WordPress export (see docs/deployment.md, "Keep old links working").
